00:08:21,130 --> 00:08:23,130
First you have to find out this.
首先你要把这些找出来。

174
00:08:23,130 --> 00:08:26,130
Next you have to decide who might be harm and how.
接下来你要确定谁可能受到伤害以及如何受到伤害。

175
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:33,130
You have to decide that whoever you have found the hazard, whoever you have found the hazard, who are you going to harm and how are you going to harm.
你要确定你找出的这些危害、你找出的这些危害会伤害到谁，以及会怎样伤害他们。

176
00:08:33,130 --> 00:08:41,130
Suppose if your work at height is going on then any tool or equipment can fall from height then it is a hazard.
假设你正在进行高处作业，那么任何工具或设备都可能从高处坠落，这就是一个危害。

177
00:08:41,130 --> 00:08:43,130
So who are you going to harm and who are you going to harm?
那么它会伤害到谁、会伤害到谁？

178
00:08:43,130 --> 00:08:48,130
So whoever workers are working on the ground level and who are you going to harm and how are you going to harm them?
也就是在地面上作业的那些工人，会伤害到谁，会怎样伤害他们？

179
00:08:48,130 --> 00:08:51,130
So you have to decide all these things.
所以这些事情你都要确定。

180
00:08:51,130 --> 00:08:54,130
Third step is evaluate the risk and take action.
第三步是评估风险并采取措施。

181
00:08:54,130 --> 00:09:04,130
You have to identify the hazard and decide how much risk you are going to take and how you are going to take action.
你要识别危害，并确定你将承担多大的风险，以及将如何采取措施。

182
00:09:04,130 --> 00:09:07,130
Fourth step is to record your findings.
第四步是记录你的发现。

183
00:09:07,130 --> 00:09:18,130
In the fourth step you have to write down all the findings that you have identified and taken action to control your risk.
在第四步中，你要把识别出的所有发现以及为控制风险所采取的措施都写下来。

184
00:09:18,130 --> 00:09:20,130
Fifth is to review.
第五步是复审。

185
00:09:20,130 --> 00:09:32,130
At the end you have to review it all the time so that if there is a change in the work, a new equipment or a change in the worker or a change in the scope of the work then some hazards can be included.
最后你要经常复审，因为如果工作发生变化、有了新设备、工人有变动或工作范围有变化，就可能出现一些新的危害。

186
00:09:32,130 --> 00:09:37,130
Some risks can be included so you have to check it and review it and update it.
也可能出现一些新的风险，所以你要检查、复审并更新。

187
00:09:37,130 --> 00:09:41,470
Next is the purpose of accident investigation.
接下来是事故调查的目的。

188
00:09:41,470 --> 00:09:45,470
Whenever there is an accident then we do the investigation.
每当发生事故时，我们都要进行调查。

189
00:09:45,470 --> 00:09:48,470
So what is the purpose of the investigation?
那么调查的目的是什么？

190
00:09:49,470 --> 00:09:59,470
So here you can see to identify the root cause of accident to identify the corrective action to prevent reoccurrence to meet the legal requirement.
这里你可以看到：查明事故的根本原因；确定纠正措施以防止再次发生；满足法律要求。

191
00:09:59,470 --> 00:10:04,470
The first reason for accident investigation is to identify the root cause of accident.
事故调查的首要原因是查明事故的根本原因。

192
00:10:04,470 --> 00:10:10,470
That means whoever had to go through an accident or had to find the root cause is the first reason.
也就是说，找出导致事故发生的根本原因是首要原因。

193
00:10:10,470 --> 00:10:14,470
Next is to identify the corrective action to prevent reoccurrence.
接下来是确定纠正措施以防止再次发生。

194
00:10:14,470 --> 00:10:21,470
You have to find the corrective action so that there is no accident in the future.
你要找出纠正措施，使将来不再发生事故。

195
00:10:21,470 --> 00:10:24,470
Third is to meet the legal requirement.
第三是满足法律要求。

196
00:10:24,470 --> 00:10:29,470
We do the investigation to meet the legal requirement.
我们进行调查是为了满足法律要求。

197
00:10:29,470 --> 00:10:31,470
Next is safety committee meeting.
接下来是安全委员会会议。

198
00:10:31,470 --> 00:10:34,470
What is the safety committee meeting?
什么是安全委员会会议？

199
00:10:34,470 --> 00:10:36,470
So here you can see the definition given.
这里你可以看到给出的定义。

200
00:10:36,470 --> 00:10:43,470
Safety committee meeting is a joint meeting among workers representatives and company management with focus on safety issues.
安全委员会会议是工人代表和公司管理层之间关注安全问题的联合会议。

201
00:10:45,850 --> 00:10:50,850
That means safety committee meeting is a meeting in which safety issues are also focused.
也就是说，安全委员会会议是一个同时关注安全问题的会议。

202
00:10:50,850 --> 00:10:55,850
So in the safety committee meeting some workers and company management meet together.
所以在安全委员会会议中，一些工人和公司管理层一起开会。

203
00:10:55,850 --> 00:10:57,850
So what is their ratio?
那么他们的比例是多少？

204
00:10:57,850 --> 00:11:06,850
So as per factory act 1948 section 41G the participants have equal number of workers representatives and management representatives.
根据《1948 年工厂法》第 41G 条，参会者中工人代表和管理层代表的人数相等。

205
00:11:06,850 --> 00:11:09,850
That means the ratio of 50-50 is in this committee meeting.
也就是说，这个委员会会议中的比例是 50 比 50。

206
00:11:09,850 --> 00:11:11,850
So you have to keep this in mind.
所以你要记住这一点。

207
00:11:11,850 --> 00:11:13,850
You can ask this question often.
这个问题经常会被问到。
